---
description: Keep git commits authored only by the repository owner
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commit attribution

- Author and committer must stay the repository owner. Do not set Cursor, the agent, or `cursoragent@cursor.com` as author or committer.
- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any other Cursor trailer to a commit message.
- Do not amend, rebase, or filter history to insert an agent identity.

The product still appends the trailer unless attribution is turned off in Cursor Settings > Agent > Attribution. This rule cannot disable that toggle.
